{"id":"c-shiji-079-fancai:m024-0521","start":521,"end":524,"surface":"信陵君","kind":"person","person_id":"qbd_5f1_qrr","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-079-fancai:m024-0533","start":533,"end":535,"surface":"魏齊","kind":"person","person_id":"wxg_l3l_wre","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-079-fancai:m024-0536","start":536,"end":539,"surface":"信陵君","kind":"person","person_id":"qbd_5f1_qrr","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-079-fancai:m024-0550","start":550,"end":552,"surface":"趙王","kind":"person","person_id":"l6g_or1_wuv","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-079-fancai:m024-0562","start":562,"end":565,"surface":"秦昭王","kind":"person","person_id":"cn8_id5_95v","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-079-fancai:m024-0567","start":567,"end":570,"surface":"平原君","kind":"person","person_id":"k2o_rv6_qyv","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-079-fancai","book_id":"b-shiji-079","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-079-fancai"},{"id":"c-shiji-079-fancai:p031","text":"蔡澤曰：「主聖臣賢，天下之盛福也；君明臣直，國之福也；父慈子孝，夫信妻貞，家之福也。故比干忠而不能存殷，子胥智而不能完吳，申生孝而晉國亂。是皆有忠臣孝子，而國家滅亂者，何也？無明君賢父以聽之，故天下以其君父為僇辱而憐其臣子。今商君、吳起、大夫種之為人臣，是也；其君，非也。故世稱三子致功而不見德，豈慕不遇世死乎？夫待死而後可以立忠成名，是微子不足仁，孔子不足聖，管仲不足大也。夫人之立功，豈不期於成全邪？身與名俱全者，上也。名可法而身死者，其次也。名在僇辱而身全者，下也。」於是應侯稱善。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-079-fancai:m031-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"蔡澤","kind":"person","person_id":"shd_1wc_uva","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-079-fancai:m031-0005","start":5,"end":9,"surface":"主聖臣賢","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、泛論、未名角色或未行方案保留，不補姓名、成員及親屬；相士預言與富貴壽長願望不當生平已證實。"},{"id":"c-shiji-079-fancai:m031-0017","start":17,"end":21,"surface":"君明臣直","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、泛論、未名角色或未行方案保留，不補姓名、成員及親屬；相士預言與富貴壽長願望不當生平已證實。"},{"id":"c-shiji-079-fancai:m031-0027","start":27,"end":31,"surface":"父慈